+/// Drops a boxed `FnMut(u8) -> bool` subscription state change handler.
+///
+/// Called by C++ (`RustBoxedCallable<bool, SubscriptionState>::dispose`) when the handler is
+/// unregistered or overridden. It must use the same closure type that
